{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Java code to GNU C++11 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following Java 11 code to GNU C++11 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original Java 11 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\nimport java.io.*;\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static final int MOD = 998244353;\n    \n    static long modPow(long base, long exp) {\n        long result = 1L;\n        base %= MOD;\n        while (exp > 0) {\n            if ((exp & 1) == 1) {\n                result = (result * base) % MOD;\n            }\n            base = (base * base) % MOD;\n            exp >>= 1;\n        }\n        return result;\n    }\n    \n    static long[] factorial;\n    \n    static long nCr(int n, int r) {\n        if (r > n || r < 0) return 0;\n        long num = factorial[n];\n        long den = (factorial[n - r] * factorial[r]) % MOD;\n        return (num * modPow(den, MOD - 2)) % MOD;\n    }\n    \n    public static void main(String[] args) throws Exception {\n        BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n        PrintWriter pw = new PrintWriter(System.out);\n        \n        factorial = new long[(int)2e5 + 1];\n        factorial[0] = 1;\n        for (int i = 1; i < factorial.length; i++) {\n            factorial[i] = (factorial[i - 1] * i) % MOD;\n        }\n        \n        String[] line = br.readLine().split(\" \");\n        int n = Integer.parseInt(line[0]);\n        long k = Long.parseLong(line[1]);\n        \n        if (k >= n) {\n            pw.println(0);\n            pw.flush();\n            return;\n        }\n        if (k == 0) {\n            pw.println(factorial[n]);\n            pw.flush();\n            return;\n        }\n        if (k == n - 1) {\n            pw.println(2 * n);\n            pw.flush();\n            return;\n        }\n        \n        int filledCols = n - (int)k;\n        long chooseCols = nCr(n, filledCols);\n        \n        long total = 0;\n        for (int empty = 0; empty <= filledCols; empty++) {\n            long waysChoose = nCr(filledCols, empty);\n            long waysFill = modPow(filledCols - empty, n);\n            long term = (waysChoose * waysFill) % MOD;\n            if (empty % 2 == 1) {\n                term = (MOD - term) % MOD;\n            }\n            total = (total + term) % MOD;\n        }\n        \n        total = (total * chooseCols) % MOD;\n        total = (total * 2) % MOD;\n        \n        pw.println(total);\n        pw.flush();\n    }\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n#include <string>\n#include <sstream>\nusing namespace std;\n\nconst int MOD = 998244353;\n\nlong long modPow(long long base, long long exp) {\n    long long result = 1LL;\n    base %= MOD;\n    while (exp > 0) {\n        if ((exp & 1) == 1) {\n            result = (result * base) % MOD;\n        }\n        base = (base * base) % MOD;\n        exp >>= 1;\n    }\n    return result;\n}\n\nvector<long long> factorial;\n\nlong long nCr(int n, int r) {\n    if (r > n || r < 0) return 0;\n    long long num = factorial[n];\n    long long den = (factorial[n - r] * factorial[r]) % MOD;\n    return (num * modPow(den, MOD - 2)) % MOD;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    string line;\n    getline(cin, line);\n    stringstream ss(line);\n    int n;\n    long long k;\n    ss >> n >> k;\n    \n    factorial.resize(200001);\n    factorial[0] = 1;\n    for (int i = 1; i < factorial.size(); i++) {\n        factorial[i] = (factorial[i - 1] * i) % MOD;\n    }\n    \n    if (k >= n) {\n        cout << 0 << endl;\n        return 0;\n    }\n    if (k == 0) {\n        cout << factorial[n] << endl;\n        return 0;\n    }\n    if (k == n - 1) {\n        cout << (2LL * n) % MOD << endl;\n        return 0;\n    }\n    \n    int filledCols = n - (int)k;\n    long long chooseCols = nCr(n, filledCols);\n    \n    long long total = 0;\n    for (int empty = 0; empty <= filledCols; empty++) {\n        long long waysChoose = nCr(filledCols, empty);\n        long long waysFill = modPow(filledCols - empty, n);\n        long long term = (waysChoose * waysFill) % MOD;\n        if (empty % 2 == 1) {\n            term = (MOD - term) % MOD;\n        }\n        total = (total + term) % MOD;\n    }\n    \n    total = (total * chooseCols) % MOD;\n    total = (total * 2) % MOD;\n    \n    cout << total << endl;\n    \n    return 0;\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.00020394629973452538, -1.7881377516459906e-06, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -0.0005819296347908676, -3.576278118089249e-07, -8.34461570775602e-06, -2.622600959512056e-06, -6.198863957251888e-06, -4.768370445162873e-07, -0.055998265743255615, -1.0490362910786644e-05, -0.00011002412065863609, -4.768370445162873e-07, -0.005665198899805546, -5.722029527532868e-06, -0.003179615829139948, -2.9801878554280847e-05, -0.026945488527417183, -0.0889415293931961, -0.3133144676685333, -3.2186455882765586e-06, -2.50339189733495e-06, -7.152555099310121e-07, -0.048602089285850525, -0.5759491920471191, -2.622600959512056e-06, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -8.344646857949556e-07, 0.0, -5.960462772236497e-07, -6.318072337307967e-06, -3.57627811